sequenceDiagram
  participant SQL as SQL Server CDC
  participant DBZ as Debezium
  participant K as Kafka
  participant C as consumer
  participant I as Iceberg raw/Silver/Gold
  participant S as SQLite state/checkpoint
  SQL->>DBZ: commit済みI/U/D
  DBZ->>K: LSN付きイベント / tombstone
  K->>C: poll
  C->>I: raw保存
  C->>S: 現在値6表の更新
  C->>I: Silver / Goldの確定
  C->>S: checkpoint保存
  C->>K: offset commit
